- Interaction Win32 Debug: build `0 Warning(s), 0 Error(s)`; execucao `DACComponentsInteraction: PASS (clean teardown)`, exit 0; SHA-256 `7C1D17FE630E74F06728D9CB114C0E58C3CBF61F1BA02102934A0CD66BC3958C`.
