- Demo canonica Win32 Debug: build completo em `Build\EXE\Win32\Debug\Demo.exe`, `0 Warning(s), 0 Error(s)`, sem executar a GUI; SHA-256 `9795B81AAC42B80D98E5DE805C02E9CE071F975EBFF196490189A3604C8BCB4D`.
