- DACDemoStartup envia WM_KEYDOWN/VK_TAB ao HWND real de TPopupDataList.
  Forward chega ao TDACDBDateTimePicker e Shift+Tab ao TDACDBComboBox, com
  popup fechado, HWND/Screen.ActiveControl efetivos e click/change 1:1.
- F4 abre Date sem reabrir Lookup; Escape fecha Date. Setas reais no popup,
  Enter/Escape, scroll e tokens Dark/Light/Dark foram preservados.
- Metricas de teste exigem install/remove/post/complete 1:1. Tres ciclos
  popup aberto + RecreateWnd exigem installs=removals e zero contexto
  residual.
- Nove builds passaram com 0 warnings/0 errors. DataAware, Smoke, Interaction
  clean teardown e DesignLifecycle passaram; lifecycle
  `0/7/0 -> 0/0/0 -> 0/0/0`.
- Startup 5/5: 1475/1209, 1605/1311, 1230/975, 1265/1073 e 1305/639 us.
- startlifecycle: PID/HWND `1252/11669472`, uma TForm1, zero modal, tres
  probes, StableMs=10390, WM_CLOSE/exit0, stdout/stderr/WER vazios e
  CURRENT_0EEDFADE=False.
- DAC_TESTING somente no Startup; helpers/metricas ausentes do map/BPL normal.
  SetWindowSubclass/RemoveWindowSubclass aparecem somente em Lookup.pas;
  diff-check limpo e zero processo residual.
- Evidencia: `Build/Tests/Evidence/MEM-DEL-DB-015/summary.txt`.

