  double post.
- Forward materializa ID=3/Maquinas com click/change 1:1, fecha Lookup, foca
  Date e F4 abre calendario. Shift+Tab materializa uma vez e foca DBCombo.
- Esc e focus-out/Cancel preservam rollback. Tres RecreateWnd continuam sem
  contexto/subclasse residual.
- Nove builds passaram com 0 warnings/0 errors. DataAware, Smoke, Interaction
  clean teardown e DesignLifecycle passaram; lifecycle
  `0/7/0 -> 0/0/0 -> 0/0/0`.
- Startup final 5/5: 1445/1150, 1136/585, 1214/650, 894/537 e
