  23376/16455098/14797, 14036/26940774/14750; WM_CLOSE
  23216/10621774/10328 (PID/HWND/StableMs).
- Onze negativos DB-026 terminaram exit1/PASS0/residual0. Controller/DFM
  preservaram hashes e os Runtime BPLs Demo/Packages ficaram identicos.
