Comando real de build:
`cmd /c 'set Path=&& set PATH=%PATH%&& call "C:\Program Files (x86)\Embarcadero\Studio\19.0\bin\rsvars.bat" && msbuild "Tests\DACComponentsInteraction.dproj" /t:Build /p:Config=Debug /p:Platform=Win32 /v:minimal'`
Resultado: exit 0, Delphi 10.2 Win32, 78514 linhas, sem warnings/erros.

